{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe agreement's allocation rule for plots is that plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement. [[cite:obs-f9210208adb0175940447ec4ef189bc4c24ce9d5 \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\"]]\n\nThe agreement does not specify the size of a plot; the \"Plots\" section contains only the sentence \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\" [[cite:obs-f9210208adb0175940447ec4ef189bc4c24ce9d5 \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\"]]\n","expected_sha256":"198deeaa49e5a38b2b1c50780170eb7b0da71d926fa0408006cd6cbe80bc42df","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Make explicit the allocation rule and state that plot size is not specified, with each statement followed by an exact quote from the agreement."}